* ============================================================
* MCC MUTATION TRINITY DISPOSABLE DRIVER
* ============================================================
* Purpose:
*   Run the disposable MCC mutation canaries for x32, vfp, x64.
*
* Rule:
*   Each child canary bootstraps its own environment.
*
* Note:
*   The VFP child remains a dev-only canary. It is useful for engine
*   drift detection and pack/header investigation, but it should not be
*   promoted into the normal public regression surface by accident.
* ============================================================

SET ECHO ON

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO MCC MUTATION TRINITY DISPOSABLE DRIVER
ECHO ============================================================

DO mcc_mutation_x32_disposable_canary
DO mcc_mutation_vfp_disposable_canary
DO mcc_mutation_x64_disposable_canary

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO MCC MUTATION TRINITY DISPOSABLE DRIVER DONE
ECHO ============================================================
